  (text "Purpose and role" (at 156.21 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold (color 0 100 110 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0306b043-b38a-5e5a-9523-9b5d23859f0a"))
  (text "Detailed circuit sheets use normal-size symbols on A4. Functional\ndivisions preserve the circuit net names and physical components."
    (at 156.21 45.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (color 33 43 55 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "e2a07e6e-a605-5bdf-8cb2-792180fc63e1"))
  (text "Inputs and outputs" (at 156.21 65.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold (color 0 100 110 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "976fcf7d-b280-5d3f-89f6-fe32f762d20f"))
  (text "Open the child sheets on the left for complete circuits. Named nets\nconnect the circuits across pages. External supply and power-control\nnets are listed in POWER_INTERFACE."
    (at 156.21 70.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (color 33 43 55 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "c85ded21-b1c8-5811-82c1-0835e12d295b"))
  (text "Control logic" (at 156.21 90.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold (color 0 100 110 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7268a517-9b33-579d-ba1c-e1b2faef146b"))
  (text "STM32H745 manages experiments; Artix-7 controls timing, routing and\nacquisition. External MATRIX_PERMIT and local hardware faults qualify\noperation."
    (at 156.21 95.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (color 33 43 55 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "d5d78156-be58-5dce-8fa8-a2aa7a152f96"))
  (text "Timing and settings" (at 156.21 115.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold (color 0 100 110 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eded3f6a-e3f5-5f62-a5dd-731fe55cbef4"))
  (text "Settings are described on each detailed sheet. DAC amplitudes settle\nbefore the FPGA creates matrix pulses. The selected NL output is\nmeasured sequentially."
    (at 156.21 120.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (color 33 43 55 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "7dd9a821-8112-5c38-be0c-cf2eec8fa22e"))
  (text "Protection and fault response"
    (at 156.21 140.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold (color 0 100 110 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "f54fd3a5-0d1f-5429-a660-5ea5f0356156"))
  (text "Supply converters and STM32G0 are in the separate power project. This\nproject includes local route interlocks, write compliance and the\nfault output MATRIX_INHIBIT_N."
    (at 156.21 145.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (color 33 43 55 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "faf11367-e1d2-5753-9c3e-da2eea045261"))
